<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.organ.stands ~ the sovereign organs, by their own act

`lares sense setup` stands the sovereign sensorium organs (content, structure, form, persistence, mesh), idempotently. Founding stands none; the py organs import the mempalace library, so a machine wanting them runs `lares mempalace install` first, and a failed organ names that cure.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ setup

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`setup` params=`~ stand the organs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ writes this host's sensorium organs; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

